      {
        "id": "tb-lagrange-basis",
        "moduleId": "polynomial-lagrange",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "拉格朗日基函数",
        "markdown": "拉格朗日插值把 $p(x)$ 仍然写成 $p(x) = \\sum_{i=0}^{n} y_i l_i(x)$，其中 $l_i(x)$ 称为**拉格朗日基函数**：\n\n$$l_i(x) = \\frac{(x - x_0)\\cdots(x - x_{i-1})(x - x_{i+1})\\cdots(x - x_n)}{(x_i - x_0)\\cdots(x_i - x_{i-1})(x_i - x_{i+1})\\cdots(x_i - x_n)}$$\n\n$l_i(x)$ 是 $n$ 次多项式，并满足 $l_i(x_j) = \\delta_{ij}$，即当 $i = j$ 时取 $1$，当 $i \\neq j$ 时取 $0$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
