      {
        "id": "model-lagrange-verification",
        "moduleId": "polynomial-lagrange",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "验证：基函数为什么能让插值条件自动成立",
        "markdown": "以节点 $x_0 = 0$、$x_1 = 1$、$x_2 = 2$ 为例，第一个基函数为\n\n$$l_0(x) = \\frac{(x-1)(x-2)}{(0-1)(0-2)} = \\frac{(x-1)(x-2)}{2}$$\n\n代入三个节点：$l_0(0) = \\frac{(-1)(-2)}{2} = 1$，$l_0(1) = 0$，$l_0(2) = 0$，正是 $l_0(x_j) = \\delta_{0j}$。\n\n于是对任意数据 $y_0, y_1, y_2$，都有 $p(x_0) = y_0 l_0(x_0) = y_0$，其余节点同理。插值条件因此自动成立，不需要再解方程组求系数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-polynomial-interpolation",
            "tb-lagrange-basis"
          ]
        }
